# Start (0,0)  first lobe SIGN=-1  finish 16.5
# Amplitude 1 m  min radius ~1.3 m  last 3.5 m straight
# Generated by scripts/s_track.py (python scripts/s_track.py --write-world).
# One DEF TRACK Pose; each painted part is ONE Shape / IndexedFaceSet (top,
# walls, end caps; solid FALSE). Replaces the 105 top-level Transform+Box
# nodes (archived in archives/butlerbot_track_boxes_2026-10-01.wbt) with the
# same footprint, colours, 6 cm stripe and heights (lines top 0.013, ticks
# 0.015, bars 0.025 above the floor).
